#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(file)s changed on disk since this editor opened. Reopen it and make the"
" change again."
msgstr ""
"%(file)s از زمان باز شدن این ویرایشگر روی دیسک تغییر کرده است. آن را دوباره "
"باز کنید و تغییر را دوباره اعمال کنید."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(file)s changed while it was being edited, most likely Traefik renewing "
"a certificate. Nothing was written, try again."
