"access log. Each needs its file mounted into this container, and each "
"view tells you the exact volume line if it is missing. CrowdSec is here "
"too, since it reads its own local API."
msgstr ""
"نماهایی که به‌جای API Traefik یک فایل را می‌خوانند: انقضای گواهی از ذخیره‌ساز "
